"[`DeepSeek-V4-Flash`](https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash) "
"weights released by DeepSeek on Hugging Face. The Attention weights use "
"MXFP8, while the MoE weights use MXFP4 with 4-bit weights and 8-bit "
"activation computation (W4A8). No Ascend-specific quantization or weight "
"conversion is required. Both the mixed-deployment example in Section 5.1 and"
" the intra-server 1P1D example in Section 5.2.3 use one Ascend 950DT server "
"(96GB × 8). The mixed deployment uses four NPUs, while the 1P1D deployment "
"assigns four NPUs to Prefill and four NPUs to Decode."
msgstr ""
