#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:317
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1091
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:319
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len` specifies the maximum context length - that is, the sum of"
" input and output tokens for a single request. Adjust it according to your "
"actual scenario."
msgstr "`--max-model-len` 指定最大上下文长度，即单个请求的输入和输出 token 之和。请根据实际场景进行调整。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:320
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` indicates the maximum number of requests that each DP group"
" is allowed to process. If the number of requests sent to the service "
"exceeds this limit, the excess requests will remain in a waiting state and "
"will not be scheduled. Note that the time spent in the waiting state is also"
" counted in metrics such as TTFT and TPOT. Therefore, when testing "
"performance, it is generally recommended that `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-"
"parallel-size` >= the actual total concurrency."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs` "
"表示每个DP组允许处理的最大请求数。如果发送到服务的请求数超过此限制，多余的请求将保持等待状态且不会被调度。请注意，等待状态所花费的时间也会计入TTFT和TPOT等指标中。因此，在进行性能测试时，通常建议`--max-"
"num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= 实际总并发数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:321
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one "
"scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes "
"more activation memory."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` "
"是单个调度步骤中处理的最大token数。较大的值可以提高prefill效率，但会消耗更多的激活内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:322
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size` sets the global number of data parallel ranks, while "
"`--tensor-parallel-size` sets the tensor parallel size within each DP rank. "
"Configure them together according to the deployment topology and available "
"NPUs."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size` 设置全局数据并行秩的数量，而`--tensor-parallel-"
"size`设置每个DP秩内的张量并行大小。请根据部署拓扑和可用的NPU一起配置它们。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:323
msgid ""
"On Ascend 950DT, DeepSeek-V4 does not currently support standalone tensor "
"parallelism (TP-only). TP partitions only the `wq_b`, `wo_a`, and `wo_b` "
"linear layers, so data parallelism is recommended. When TP is required, use "
"it together with DSA-CP and enable FlashComm (`enable_flashcomm1`) and DSA-"
"CP (`enable_dsa_cp`), as in the two-server DeepSeek-V4-Pro mixed deployment."
msgstr ""
"在Ascend "
"950DT上，DeepSeek-V4目前不支持独立的张量并行（仅TP）。TP仅对`wq_b`、`wo_a`和`wo_b`线性层进行分区，因此建议使用数据并行。当需要TP时，请与DSA-"
"CP一起使用，并启用FlashComm（`enable_flashcomm1`）和DSA-"
"CP（`enable_dsa_cp`），如双服务器DeepSeek-V4-Pro混合部署中所示。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:324
msgid ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not"
" mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer."
msgstr "`--enable-expert-parallel` 为MoE层启用专家并行。请勿在同一MoE层中混合使用MoE张量并行和专家并行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:325
msgid ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` indicates that prefix caching is disabled. To "
"enable it, remove this option."
msgstr "`--no-enable-prefix-caching` 表示禁用前缀缓存。如需启用，请移除该选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:326
msgid ""
"`--block-size` sets the KV cache block size. To enable the experimental 4K "
"prefix cache hit support, change it from `128` to `32`."
msgstr "`--block-size` 设置KV缓存块大小。要启用实验性的4K前缀缓存命中支持，请将其从`128`改为`32`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:327
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W8A8 model used "
"in the A2 and A3 configurations. The original DeepSeek-V4-Flash weights used"
" on Ascend 950DT do not require this option."
msgstr ""
"`--quantization ascend`为A2和A3配置中使用的W8A8模型启用Ascend量化。在Ascend "
"950DT上使用的原始DeepSeek-V4-Flash权重不需要此选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:328
msgid ""
"`--speculative-config` configures the MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) "
"speculative decoding to accelerate inference."
msgstr "`--speculative-config` 配置 MTP（多 token 预测）推测解码以加速推理。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:329
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables "
"full ACL graph execution in the decode phase to reduce scheduling latency."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` "
"在解码阶段启用完整的 ACL 图执行，以减少调度延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:330
msgid ""
"`--async-scheduling` enables asynchronous scheduling to overlap CPU "
"scheduling with NPU computation."
msgstr "`--async-scheduling` 启用异步调度，使 CPU 调度与 NPU 计算重叠。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:331
msgid ""
"`--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. "
"`enable_npugraph_ex` enables enhanced ACL graph execution, "
"`enable_static_kernel: false` keeps static-kernel compilation disabled, "
"`enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-native CPU binding, `enable_dsa_cp` "
"enables DSA context parallelism, `enable_shared_expert_dp` enables data "
"parallelism for shared experts, and `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` "
"overlaps shared expert computation for better MoE throughput. DSA-CP depends"
" on FlashComm1, and both options must be enabled explicitly."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-"
"config`启用Ascend特定的优化。`enable_npugraph_ex`启用增强的ACL图执行，`enable_static_kernel: "
"false`保持禁用静态内核编译，`enable_cpu_binding`启用Ascend原生CPU绑定，`enable_dsa_cp`启用DSA上下文并行，`enable_shared_expert_dp`为共享专家启用数据并行，`multistream_overlap_shared_expert`重叠共享专家计算以提高MoE吞吐量。DSA-"
"CP依赖于FlashComm1，两个选项都必须显式启用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:332
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1` enables the FlashComm communication "
"optimization."
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1` 启用 FlashComm 通信优化。"

