#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:358
msgid "5.2 Multi-Node PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "5.2 多节点 PD 分离部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:360
msgid ""
"We recommend using Mooncake for deployment: "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用 Mooncake "
"进行部署：[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:362
msgid ""
"In the standard single-node deployment mode, Prefill (prompt processing) and"
" Decode (token generation) tasks run on the same set of NPUs. This can lead "
"to two issues:"
msgstr "在标准单节点部署模式下，Prefill（提示处理）和 Decode（token 生成）任务运行在同一组 NPU 上。这可能导致两个问题："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:364
msgid ""
"**Prefill preemption interrupts Decode**: Prefill is a compute-intensive "
"task that processes the entire input context at once, while Decode generates"
" tokens one by one. When a new user request arrives, its Prefill phase can "
"preempt and interrupt ongoing Decode tasks, causing jitter and higher time-"
"per-output-token (TPOT) latency."
msgstr ""
"**Prefill 抢占中断 Decode**：Prefill 是计算密集型任务，一次性处理整个输入上下文，而 Decode 逐个生成 "
"token。当新用户请求到达时，其 Prefill 阶段可能会抢占并中断正在进行的 Decode 任务，导致抖动和更高的每个输出 token "
"时间（TPOT）延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:365
msgid ""
"**Inflexible resource allocation**: Prefill and Decode have fundamentally "
"different computational characteristics — Prefill is compute-bound and "
"memory-bandwidth-intensive, while Decode is memory-bandwidth-bound. Running "
"them on the same hardware forces a compromise that satisfies neither "
"optimally."
msgstr ""
"**资源分配不灵活**：Prefill和Decode具有根本不同的计算特性——Prefill是计算密集型和内存带宽密集型，而Decode是内存带宽受限型。在相同硬件上运行它们会迫使做出折中，无法使两者都达到最优。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:367
msgid ""
"PD (Prefill-Decode) separation addresses these issues by running Prefill and"
" Decode on dedicated node groups, each configured independently. This "
"architecture is recommended for production deployments with concurrent "
"multi-user workloads, where stable latency and high throughput are both "
"required."
msgstr ""
"PD（Prefill-"
"Decode）分离通过将Prefill和Decode运行在专用节点组上（每组独立配置）来解决这些问题。对于需要同时保证稳定延迟和高吞吐量的并发多用户生产部署，推荐采用此架构。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:369
msgid ""
"The following sections describe PD separation deployment on Atlas 800 A3 "
"nodes (128GB × 8), Atlas 800 A2 nodes (64GB × 8), and Ascend 950DT servers "
"(96GB × 8)."
msgstr ""
"以下章节描述了在Atlas 800 A3节点（128GB × 8）、Atlas 800 A2节点（64GB × 8）和Ascend "
