msgstr "5.2.2 A2系列PD分离部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:665
msgid ""
"This section shows the deployment guide of DeepSeek-V4-Flash on Atlas 800 A2"
" (64GB × 8) multi-node environment with 4\\*1P 1\\*4D for better "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍DeepSeek-V4-Flash在Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）多节点环境下采用4\\*1P "
"1\\*4D配置以获得更优性能的部署指南。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:740
msgid "Prefill node (4 P nodes share the same script)"
msgstr "Prefill节点（4个P节点共享同一脚本）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:742
msgid ""
"For each P instance, only these two configuration values need to be "
"modified: `kv_port` and `engine_id`. The `engine_id` should start from 0 and"
" increment sequentially, while the `kv_port` (e.g., `30100`) must be unique "
"for each P instance, such as 30000, 30100, etc."
msgstr ""
"对于每个P实例，只需修改以下两个配置值：`kv_port`和`engine_id`。`engine_id`应从0开始依次递增，而`kv_port`（例如`30100`）对于每个P实例必须唯一，如30000、30100等。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:821
msgid "Decode node (4 D nodes share the same script)"
msgstr "Decode节点（4个D节点共享同一脚本）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:916
msgid ""
"For each P instance, only the `--dp-address` parameter differs and must be "
"configured as the IP address of the service within the same subnet as the "
"other instances."
msgstr "对于每个P实例，只有`--dp-address`参数不同，必须配置为与其他实例在同一子网内的服务IP地址。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:925
msgid ""
"For each D instance, only the `--dp-rank-start` parameter differs, which "
"should be configured as 0, 8, 16, and 24 respectively. Each instance's "
"`--dp-address` must be set to the IP address of the main D node, which is "
"the IP of the Decode instance with `--dp-rank-start` set to 0."
msgstr ""
"对于每个D实例，只有`--dp-rank-start`参数不同，应分别配置为0、8、16和24。每个实例的`--dp-"
"address`必须设置为主D节点的IP地址，即`--dp-rank-start`设置为0的Decode实例的IP。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:929
msgid ""
"The proxy is also implemented by referring to [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation"
" (Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)."
msgstr ""
"代理的实现同样参考[Prefill-Decode分离 "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:931
msgid "5.2.3 Ascend 950DT Series PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "5.2.3 Ascend 950DT系列PD分离部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:933
msgid ""
"This section shows an intra-server 1P1D deployment on one Ascend 950DT "
"server (96GB × 8). The Prefill instance uses NPUs 0-3 with `DP4/TP1`, and "
"the Decode instance uses NPUs 4-7 with `DP4/TP1`. You can add Prefill or "
"Decode instances as needed based on the workload's input/output "
"characteristics and service requirements. An expert-parallel size "
"(`ep_size`) of 4 is recommended for each instance. The `prefill` and "
"`decode` parallel settings in `--kv-transfer-config` must match the actual "
"engine settings after scaling."
msgstr ""
"本节展示在一台Ascend 950DT服务器（96GB × 8）上的服务器内1P1D部署。Prefill实例使用NPU "
"0-3，配置为`DP4/TP1`，Decode实例使用NPU "
"4-7，配置为`DP4/TP1`。您可以根据工作负载的输入/输出特性和服务需求按需添加Prefill或Decode实例。建议每个实例的专家并行大小（`ep_size`）为4。`--kv-"
"transfer-config`中的`prefill`和`decode`并行设置必须与扩展后的实际引擎设置匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:935
msgid ""
"Before starting the service, mount `/etc/hixlep/` into the container and "
"replace `nic_name`, `local_ip`, and the model path with values from your "
"environment."
msgstr "启动服务前，请将`/etc/hixlep/`挂载到容器中，并将`nic_name`、`local_ip`和模型路径替换为您环境中的实际值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:937
msgid "Prepare `run_prefill.sh`."
msgstr "准备`run_prefill.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1007
msgid "Prepare `run_decode.sh`."
msgstr "准备`run_decode.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1077
msgid "Start the Prefill and Decode services in separate terminals."
msgstr "在单独的终端中启动Prefill和Decode服务。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1089
msgid ""
"Refer to [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) and "
"configure the Prefill endpoint as `<local_ip>:8000` and the Decode endpoint "
"as `<local_ip>:8001`."
msgstr ""
"请参考[Prefill-"
"Decode分离（Deepseek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)，并将Prefill端点配置为`<local_ip>:8000`，Decode端点配置为`<local_ip>:8001`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1093
msgid ""
"`--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager "
"enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the "
"service may OOM during startup."
msgstr ""
"`--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合KV缓存管理器启用。DeepSeek-V4 KV "
"Pool部署需要此标志；否则，服务在启动期间可能会发生OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1094
msgid ""
"`--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on prefill nodes instead of graph "
"compilation."
msgstr "`--enforce-eager` 强制在prefill节点上使用即时执行模式，而不是图编译。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1095
msgid ""
"`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout on "
"the prefill and decode sides."
msgstr ""
"`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与prefill和decode侧的实际全局DP和TP布局相匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1096
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`: enables the communication optimization "
"function on the prefill nodes."
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`：在prefill节点上启用通信优化功能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1097
msgid ""
"`recompute_scheduler_enable: true`: enables the recomputation scheduler. "
"When the KV Cache of the decode node is insufficient, requests will be sent "
"to the prefill node to recompute the KV Cache. In the PD separation "
"scenario, enable this configuration only on decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`recompute_scheduler_enable: true`：启用重计算调度器。当decode节点的KV "
"Cache不足时，请求将被发送到prefill节点重新计算KV Cache。在PD分离场景中，仅在decode节点上启用此配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1098
msgid ""
"`MooncakeHybridConnector`: the KV transfer connector used for PD separation,"
" transferring KV Cache between prefill and decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`MooncakeHybridConnector`：用于PD分离的KV传输连接器，在prefill和decode节点之间传输KV Cache。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1099
msgid ""
"`enable_shared_expert_dp: true`: enables data parallelism for shared "
"experts, applicable to MoE models."
msgstr "`enable_shared_expert_dp: true`：为共享专家启用数据并行，适用于MoE模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1100
msgid ""
"On Ascend 950DT, `ascend_local_comm_res_path` specifies the local "
"communication resource directory used by the KV connector. The directory "
"must be available at the same path in the container."
msgstr ""
"在Ascend "
"950DT上，`ascend_local_comm_res_path`指定KV连接器使用的本地通信资源目录。该目录必须在容器中的相同路径下可用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1102
msgid "Deployment Verification:"
msgstr "部署验证："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1104
msgid ""
"After the PD separation service is fully started, send a request through the"
" proxy port on the prefill master node to verify that Prefill and Decode "
"nodes are working correctly together. Refer to [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for the "
"proxy verification method."
msgstr ""
"PD分离服务完全启动后，通过prefill主节点上的代理端口发送请求，验证Prefill和Decode节点是否协同工作正常。代理验证方法请参考[Prefill-"
"Decode分离 (Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1106
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If you encounter issues with PD separation deployment, "
"please refer to the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html) for "
"troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果遇到PD分离部署问题，请参考[公共FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)进行故障排除。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1108
msgid "5.2.4 Ultra-Long Sequence Deployment"
msgstr "5.2.4 超长序列部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md:1110
msgid ""
"For ultra-long sequence scenarios, support can be achieved by adjusting the "
"PD (Prefill/Decode) ratio and the model parallelism strategy. For example, "
"in a 1M sequence scenario, a 1\\*4P-1\\*4D ratio can be used, with the model"
" parallelism set to DP4TP8 mode."
msgstr ""
"对于超长序列场景，可以通过调整PD（Prefill/Decode）比例和模型并行策略来提供支持。例如，在1M序列场景中，可以使用1\\*4P-1\\*4D的比例，并将模型并行设置为DP4TP8模式。"

